// The six rooms this kiosk routes to.
//
// Read at startup from ./config next to the binary, so directions can be
// corrected without a rebuild. SignalId must be unique: two rooms sharing an
// indicator means the column points at the wrong place half the time, and
// startup fails if you duplicate one.
